"P2879865619" "Longbow has a communications officer operating in Bloody Bay. If we can find and interrogate him he can provide excellent intel on Longbow activities in the area!<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Longbow base and interrogate their communications officer!</A><br><br>Their communications officer is being moved soon to Longbow command to relay the intel he has gathered. You have 60 minutes to complete the mission!<br><br><color red>PvP Mission: This mission will bring you into direct conflict with heroes.</color>"
