"P1395882948" "One of Longbow's researchers has developed a new ablative compound which can be applied to uniforms to temporarily enhance its protective capabilities. We need to steal that shipment! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Longbow base where the compound is being prepared for delivery and steal the shipment.</A><br><br>Longbow will be shipping it out to their agents very soon. You have 60 minutes to complete this mission!<br><br><color red>PvP Mission: This mission will bring you into direct conflict with heroes.</color>"
